      <unicode>ᠴᠢᠷᠠᠶᠢᠯᠠᠬᠣ</unicode>
      <uighur>čirayilaqu</uighur>
      <definition>To look at a person. To look into the face of a person.</definition>
      <page>1325</page>
    </entry_item>
